@startuml
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

actor "Pengurus / Bendahara" as Pengurus
boundary "Halaman Unggah\n(/unggah)" as UploadPage
control "Reports API\n(/api/reports)" as ReportsAPI
participant "Supabase Storage\n(Bucket: report-photos)" as Storage
entity "Database\n(Prisma: Report & Attachment)" as DB

Pengurus -> UploadPage : Buka /unggah & pilih tanggal Jumat
activate UploadPage
Pengurus -> UploadPage : Pilih / drop file (JPG/PNG/PDF/Excel)
Pengurus -> UploadPage : Klik tombol "Unggah Laporan"

UploadPage -> UploadPage : Validasi file & hari Jumat di sisi klien
UploadPage -> ReportsAPI : POST multipart/form-data (reportDate, files[])
activate ReportsAPI

ReportsAPI -> ReportsAPI : Verifikasi sesi pengurus aktif
alt Sesi tidak valid / bukan pengurus
  ReportsAPI --> UploadPage : 401 Unauthorized
  UploadPage -> Pengurus : Tampilkan peringatan akses dibatasi
else Sesi valid
  loop Untuk setiap file yang diunggah
    ReportsAPI -> Storage : Upload file binary buffer
    activate Storage
    Storage --> ReportsAPI : fileUrl & metadata storage
    deactivate Storage
  end

  ReportsAPI -> DB : prisma.report.create({\n  data: { reportDate, year, month, weekOfMonth, uploadedById,\n  attachments: { create: [{ fileUrl, fileType, originalFileName, ... }] }\n}})
  activate DB
  DB --> ReportsAPI : Created Report with Attachments
  deactivate DB

  ReportsAPI --> UploadPage : 201 Created (reportId, attachments)
  deactivate ReportsAPI

  UploadPage -> UploadPage : router.push("/laporan/" + reportId)
  UploadPage -> Pengurus : Navigasi ke detail laporan yang baru diunggah
end
deactivate UploadPage

@enduml
